From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 03:46:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ios: fix bigstack exit crash, guest quit to shell, and - + +
 hold

Also wake and drain AudRen's PCM output thread before dm_threads_park_all and move dm_audio_stop_all after thread parking so dispatch_release(rel_sem) never traps with SIGTRAP on shell exit.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Fix SIGSEGV in bs_free on active bigstack, SIGTRAP in AudRen/AudioOut shell teardown, route guest exit back to shell, reset GL state on teardown, and add - + + 2s hold to quit
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple (v1.5.0 local)
